> Since the notion of the virtualized image of field 0 in these blocks [or=
=20
> files if you will] is also compatible with debugging, P?S/8 ODT can work=
=20
> with the image.  If necessary, the image work can be deferred by saving t=
he=20
> two files to any other two files respectively, to be restored later for=
